WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.934 --> 00:00:16.744
"What a beautiful day!" said Emmy.

2
00:00:16.745 --> 00:00:20.228
"I don't want to be in the house.

3
00:00:20.229 --> 00:00:23.651
Let's play in the backyard."

4
00:00:23.652 --> 00:00:31.231
"That's a great idea," said Harry.

5
00:00:31.232 --> 00:00:34.001
The kids went outside.

6
00:00:34.003 --> 00:00:40.589
Harry and Emmy played tag.

7
00:00:40.590 --> 00:00:45.313
Oliver was eating a granola bar.

8
00:00:45.314 --> 00:00:48.400
He saw a big green bug in a tree.

9
00:00:48.401 --> 00:00:55.732
Oliver put down his granola bar.

10
00:00:55.733 --> 00:01:01.195
"Look!" said Oliver.

11
00:01:01.196 --> 00:01:04.891
"That bug looks like a leaf!"

12
00:01:04.892 --> 00:01:09.525
"It's a leaf bug," said Emmy.

13
00:01:09.526 --> 00:01:15.688
"Cool!" said Harry.

14
00:01:15.689 --> 00:01:18.661
A bird flew down from the sky.

15
00:01:18.662 --> 00:01:23.388
It pecked at the granola bar.

16
00:01:23.389 --> 00:01:26.339
"Oh no!" cried Oliver.

17
00:01:26.340 --> 00:01:29.967
"A bird is eating my granola bar!"

18
00:01:29.968 --> 00:01:34.451
The bird flew away.

19
00:01:34.452 --> 00:01:37.764
A squirrel jumped onto the bird feeder.

20
00:01:37.765 --> 00:01:42.419
It ate some bird food.

21
00:01:42.420 --> 00:01:46.306
"Ha-ha!" Oliver laughed.

22
00:01:46.307 --> 00:01:50.870
A cat was walking on the fence.

23
00:01:50.871 --> 00:01:53.673
"It's Pickles," said Emmy.

24
00:01:53.674 --> 00:01:58.341
"He's the neighbor's cat."

25
00:01:58.342 --> 00:02:01.607
Pickles jumped down from the fence.

26
00:02:01.608 --> 00:02:08.480
He came over to the kids.

27
00:02:08.481 --> 00:02:11.021
The kids patted Pickles.

28
00:02:11.022 --> 00:02:15.126
The cat purred.

29
00:02:15.127 --> 00:02:18.856
He rolled over onto his back.

30
00:02:18.857 --> 00:02:25.143
"This is fun," said Oliver.

31
00:02:25.144 --> 00:02:29.316
"Our backyard is really exciting!"

32
00:02:29.317 --> 00:02:33.637
Another animal climbed over the fence.

33
00:02:33.638 --> 00:02:36.319
"Look over there!" said Oliver.

34
00:02:36.320 --> 00:02:41.039
"It's another cat!"

35
00:02:41.040 --> 00:02:48.827
"I don't think that's a cat," said Harry.

36
00:02:48.828 --> 00:02:51.547
"It's a skunk!" cried Emmy.

37
00:02:51.548 --> 00:03:04.905
"Everybody, back in the house!"
